      "limits": "Directory/result/season: actual reads from an unfunded now-superseded StudioNet candidate. Ticket/pairing: controlled transport. Not proof of wallet transfers, funded pool settlement, native credit, replacement-contract behavior, deployment or Portal readiness. No new review/browser/detector pass."
    }
